    "new": "### Use cases (new, 9)"
  },
  {
    "line": 301,
    "old": null,
    "new": "UC-1 Log each user request as exactly one turn. Actors: Operator, agent host (any of the eight), plugin hooks or tools, model. Precondition: workspace trusted (marker signature and health nonce verified). Basic flow: operator submits a prompt; host delivers it (possibly twice); plugin classifies it as a user request, takes the turn-open lock, checks the prompt ledger, opens one turn, records it in the stop ledger; model writes actions and decisions to that turn by requestId; model closes it. Alternate flows: duplicate delivery reuses the requestId; background event is skipped; operator sends a message mid-turn and a second turn opens without touching the first; a subagent's hooks fire and leave this session's turns unchanged. Realizes FR-MCP-SESSIONTURN-001, -002, -003, -007, -008; updated FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-001, FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-002, FR-MCP-REPL-010, FR-MCP-TRIAGESTORE-001."
  },
  {
    "line": 302,
    "old": null,
    "new": "UC-2 Persist session-log writes with truthful receipts. Actors: model, plugin, server. Basic flow: model calls a verb; plugin persists; server returns per-turn outcome; plugin reports persisted only for created/merged. Alternate: target turn is terminal, server reports `skipped_terminal`, plugin reports `persisted:false`, exits non-zero, clears the failsafe; legacy server without outcomes yields `outcomeVerified:false`. Realizes FR-MCP-SESSIONTURN-004; updated FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-003, FR-MCP-PLUGININT-001."
  },
  {
    "line": 303,
    "old": null,
    "new": "UC-3 Close every request turn before stopping. Actors: model, host Stop hook. Basic flow: model records actions/decisions (incl. via `designDecisions`) and closes each turn; Stop hook finds all closed with evidence and passes, clearing the ledger. Alternate: a turn is open or lacks evidence or fails the completion gate, the Stop hook blocks with the reason and never closes turns itself. Realizes FR-MCP-SESSIONTURN-005, -006; updated FR-MCP-SESSIONLIFE-005, FR-MCP-CLEARSESSION-001."
  },
  {
    "line": 304,
    "old": null,
    "new": "UC-4 Classify a request. Actors: model. Basic flow: model sets `requestClass` (Code, Docs, Chore) on its turn; hostile record flips to Unnecessary for Chore. Alternate: invalid value rejected. Realizes FR-MCP-SESSIONCLASS-001, FR-MCP-SESSIONREVIEW-006."
  },
  {
    "line": 305,
    "old": null,
    "new": "UC-5 Complete or fail a turn under the completion gate. Actors: model, server, server-internal writers. Basic flow: model completes; gate checks class and review statuses; turn completes. Alternate: gate unmet, 400 with missing items, turn stays in progress; fail requires only class; exempt origins bypass. Realizes FR-MCP-SESSIONCLASS-002, -003, -004; updated FR-SUPPORT-013, FR-SUPPORT-014."
  },
  {
    "line": 306,
    "old": null,
    "new": "UC-6 Record an agent self-review. Actors: model via any of the eight plugins. Basic flow: model records `agentReview` (Running, then scores); server derives Pass/Fail from thresholds and stamps them. Alternate: conflicting supplied status 422; invalid fields 400; review recorded after completion. Realizes FR-MCP-SESSIONREVIEW-001, -002, -003, -006, -008; updated FR-SUPPORT-010G, FR-MCP-SESSIONLOGSAN-001."
  },
  {
